        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>八款最好喝的梅酒</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        body {\n            background-color: #363b59;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', 'SimHei', sans-serif;\n        }\n        .outer-container {\n            background-color: #f1e8d6;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n        .inner-border {\n            border: 4px solid #891e1d;\n            padding-top: 30px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        .main-title {\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #891e1d;\n            font-size: 3.8em;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            letter-spacing: 3px;\n        }\n        .subtitle-wrapper {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .subtitle {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #891e1d;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 1.8em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            padding: 12px 50px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            letter-spacing: 10px;\n        }\n        .divider {\n            border-top: 4px solid #891e1d;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n        .grid-container {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        }\n        .item {\n            display: flex;\n            padding: 35px 25px;\n            gap: 20px;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        /* Dotted borders for grid */\n        .item:nth-child(odd) {\n            border-right: 6px dotted #891e1d;\n        }\n        .item:nth-child(1), .item:nth-child(2),\n        .item:nth-child(3), .item:nth-child(4),\n        .item:nth-child(5), .item:nth-child(6) {\n            border-bottom: 6px dotted #891e1d;\n        }\n        \n        .placeholder {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 180px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            background-color: #e3d6c0;\n            border: 1px dashed #b8a68b;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #666;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n        .text-content {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        .item-title {\n            align-self: flex-start;\n            border: 4px solid #891e1d;\n            color: #891e1d;\n            font-size: 1.3em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        .item-desc {\n            color: #111;\n            font-size: 0.95em;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"outer-container\">\n        <div class=\"inner-border\">\n            <h1 class=\"main-title\">八款最好喝的梅酒</h1>\n            <div class=\"subtitle-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"subtitle\">女生微醺必备酒款</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid-container\">\n                <!-- Item 1 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">山崎梅酒樽仕入</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">山崎入门级梅酒，也是最经典的一款，口感也是接受度最高的一款。目前已经停产，市场上存量越来越少，想喝或者想收藏小伙伴可以尽快尝试一下。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 2 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">山崎梅酒樽酿</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">代替樽仕入经典款的新产品，与经典款相同的是，都是使用白兰地作为基酒，但是新款的酒精提到了20度，相比经典款香味与烟熏味道更重一些。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 3 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">俏雅黑金本格</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">这是一款白兰地本格梅酒，所以品尝起来会感觉洋酒的味道浓厚一些，可以搭配气泡水一起饮用，口感会更顺滑。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 4 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">杂贺纪州梅酒</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">闻名遐迩的杂贺清酒为酒底，放入梅子加以浸泡，最后再放入美味的梅子酱，口感浓稠甘甜，而青梅的酸度对健康多有益处。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 5 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">三得利梅酒</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">这款是三得利旗下的经典梅酒，酸甜爽口，口感愉悦，冰镇后梅酒的口感进一步被激发，再加上一杯苏打水，不论是配餐还是睡前独酌都是很好的选择。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 6 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">明石信威士忌梅酒</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">女生会喜欢的威士忌梅酒，黄金比例调配，醇厚香甜的酒体，细腻顺口的口感。第一次尝试时，让人很难感受到威士忌的存在，直到喝完后的回甘才发现它们完美的融合在了一起。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 7 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Image: Wine Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">蝶矢黑糖梅酒</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">来自冲绳的黑糖与梅酒的完美融合，黑糖里的甘蔗矿物质给梅酒带来了独特的芳香甜味，推荐与牛奶一起搭配，口感顺滑醇厚又饱满~</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Item 8 -->\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 100px;\">[Image: Box & Bottle]</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-content\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">长乐无忧梅酒</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-desc\">一款国产的优秀梅酒，被超高颜值吸引来尝试，被其超棒的口感俘获，清爽顺滑的口感，入口后，淡淡的青梅香一直保留，值得一提的是，这款酒十分健康，即便是正在身材管理的女生也可以放心饮用~</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
